    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that doesnt really make sense, i've checked the exhaust and it's fine. the pressure spikes are happening specifically during the 2-3 and 3-4 shifts. could it be a solenoid issue or something with the valve body? i'm trying to rule out internal mechanical failure before i start pulling the pan.",
