    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "alright, i'll check those solenoids. but what if they come out looking totally fine? i've seen cases where the pressure jumps around even when everything looks physically okay on the outside. is there anything else that could be causing such erratic behavior in the hydraulic circuit?",
